  "reason": "Issue #3355 flow_resume runs the flow engine only when ARI_FLOW_ENGINE=on, stamps rows with Ari's model identity (local only when ARI_LOCAL_MODEL_ENABLED is set), and shares the rendition type whose V2 switch defaults off; unset values keep each path disabled. ARI_UNDERSTAND_FIRST=on|off overrides the staged \"Ari understands first\" rollout (ariRollout.ts) for a local stack or an eval run; unset, the rollout rows decide."
